---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Get WorkLog — web app and Android download" description="Open WorkLog in your browser. The signed Android installer will be available here when the first release is ready.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container narrow"><span class="eyebrow">GET STARTED WITH WORKLOG</span><h1>Choose how you want to use it.</h1><p class="hero-lede">Open the web app now. An Android installer will be added here after the release package is signed and ready to share.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section section-space"><div class="container download-grid">
    <article class="download-card download-card-primary"><span class="download-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8m-4-4v4"/></svg></span><span class="eyebrow">AVAILABLE NOW</span><h2>Use WorkLog on the web</h2><p>Sign in or create your account in your browser. Your WorkLog records are stored with your account.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/app/#/login">Open WorkLog <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
    <article class="download-card"><span class="download-icon muted-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v12m-5-5 5 5 5-5M5 17v3h14v-3"/></svg></span><span class="eyebrow">ANDROID</span><h2>APK release is being prepared</h2><p>We’ll publish the signed installer and version notes here after the Android package ID and release signing are finalized.</p><button class="button button-disabled" type="button" disabled aria-disabled="true">Download not available yet</button></article>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section solution-section"><div class="container narrow"><h2>How app updates will work</h2><p>For direct APK releases, you’ll download and install the new version over the current app—no uninstall needed when the package ID and signing key stay the same. The web app updates when a new site version is deployed. We’ll show the APK version and release notes on this page.</p></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
